    "AID stands for Automated Insulin Delivery system. Such systems can provide extra information, like Loop Status, IOB, COB, Eventual Glucose, prediction lines and more." : {
      "comment" : "A footnote describing what \"AID\" stands for and their capabilities.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AID står for Automatiseret Insulin Doseringssystem. Sådanne systemer kan give ekstra information, f. eks. Loop Status, IOB, COB, Eventuel Glukose, forudsigelser og mere."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AID stands for Automated Insulin Delivery system. Such systems can provide extra information, like Loop Status, IOB, COB, Eventual Glucose, prediction lines and more."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AID significa sistema de entrega de insulina automatizada, estos sistemas pueden proporcionar información adicional, como el estado de bucle, IOB, COB, Glucosa Eventual, líneas de predicción y más."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DAI est synonyme de système de Distribution Automatique d'Insuline. Ces systèmes peuvent fournir des informations supplémentaires, telles que l'état de la boucle, l'IàB, les glucides actifs, la valeur prédite de glucose, les lignes de prédiction et plus encore."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AID sta per il sistema Automated Insulin Delivery system. Tali sistemi possono fornire informazioni aggiuntive, come Loop Status, IOB, COB, Eventual Glucosio, linee di previsione e altro ancora."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AID staat voor Automated Insulin Delivery systeem. Dergelijke systemen kunnen extra informatie bieden, zoals Loop Status, IOB, COB, Eventual Glucose, voorspellingslijnen en meer."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AID oznacza zautomatyzowany system dostarczania insuliny. Takie systemy mogą dostarczyć dodatkowych informacji, takich jak Status pętli, IOB, COB, Glukoza ostateczna, linie prognostyczne i więcej."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AID reprezintă sistemul automat de livrare a insulinei. Astfel de sisteme pot oferi informaţii suplimentare, cum ar fi Loop Status, IOB, COB, Eventual Glucose, linii de predicţie şi multe altele."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AID står för Automated Insulin Delivery system. Sådana system kan ge extra information, som Loop Status, IOB, COB, Eventual Glucose, förutsägelser linjer och mer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
