    "Log files are stored in ~/Library/Application Support/tools.t1d.GlucoseBar/logs/. Each session creates a new debug.log; the previous session is renamed with a timestamp." : {
      "comment" : "A description of where and how debug logs are stored.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Logfiler gemmes i ~/Library/Application Support/tools.t1d.GlucoseBar/logs/. Hver session opretter en ny debug.log; den foregående session omdøbes med et tidsstempel."
